    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/b891c62170a114262fd04a005bddfe90.avif?t=1755502638\" data-has-big width=800 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'Deadly Trick' is a anime style social deduction game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your ultimate goal is to complete the class activities and survive the deadly 'Special Class' at Lastope School.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/52db11baf8712860b342932806c1dd46.poster.avif?t=1755502638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/52db11baf8712860b342932806c1dd46.webm?t=1755502638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather your friends and play together!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Trick is designed for 5 to 8 players.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/92e512a6bdf30d6d42dfcd3103f4841c.avif?t=1755502638\" width=600 height=862 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Deadly Trick, players choose their own roles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depending on your choice, you can become a kind-hearted &quot;White&quot; or a ruthless &quot;Shadow&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/1e2fc14d0bcdd26f692abbde62b8097c.poster.avif?t=1755502638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/1e2fc14d0bcdd26f692abbde62b8097c.webm?t=1755502638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/1e2fc14d0bcdd26f692abbde62b8097c.mp4?t=1755502638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you choose to be the White,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete the class activities and escape from the school! </strong> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/ede1e121fd7967ee76b0233ef4cff825.poster.avif?t=1755502638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/ede1e121fd7967ee76b0233ef4cff825.webm?t=1755502638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/ede1e121fd7967ee76b0233ef4cff825.mp4?t=1755502638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you decide to become the Shadow...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secretly eliminate the other participants!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/238140fda93c7bc1eef8e08003918751.poster.avif?t=1755502638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/238140fda93c7bc1eef8e08003918751.webm?t=1755502638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/238140fda93c7bc1eef8e08003918751.mp4?t=1755502638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When an incident occurs, an investigation begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players gather clues at the crime scene to figure out who the Shadow is.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During the &quot;Class Trial&quot; that follows the investigation, you must identify the culprit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you fail to pinpoint the culprit during the trial...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/2d6da333c7415a9fa5aad4b68245153c.poster.avif?t=1755502638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/2d6da333c7415a9fa5aad4b68245153c.webm?t=1755502638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/2d6da333c7415a9fa5aad4b68245153c.mp4?t=1755502638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyone except the Shadow will be immediately executed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That\u2019s why it\u2019s crucial to discuss thoroughly and deduce who the Black really is!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/a59100c1e085478716518bedb28943b2.poster.avif?t=1755502638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/a59100c1e085478716518bedb28943b2.webm?t=1755502638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/a59100c1e085478716518bedb28943b2.mp4?t=1755502638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/77167221eecfe1229de5ac196f200c54.poster.avif?t=1755502638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/77167221eecfe1229de5ac196f200c54.webm?t=1755502638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/77167221eecfe1229de5ac196f200c54.mp4?t=1755502638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organize the clues you\u2019ve gathered into &quot;statements,&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share and review each other's statements,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>and use them to advance your deductions and find the culprit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/a0e3a932ea9ba7ec56a2f7755d6607c0.poster.avif?t=1755502638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/a0e3a932ea9ba7ec56a2f775